WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:03.269
&gt;&gt;&gt; NOW RERETURN TO OUR FEATURE
PRESENTATION, THE DOLPHIN WHO

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:08.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
LEARNED TO SPEAK.
&gt;&gt; IN THE 1960s, THERE WAS A

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.010
GROUND SWELL OF SCIENTIFIC
RESEARCH INTO THE MINDS OF

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:18.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
ANIMALS.
THE MALLAL COGNITION LAB WAS

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
PRIMARILY
FOCUSED ON DOLPHIN

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
COMMUNICATIONS.
&gt;&gt; WE WERE A TWO-WOMAN TEAM

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:24.190
EAGER TO PROVE OURSELVES IN THE
MALE MALE DOMINATED FIELD OF

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:27.627
SCIENCE.
&gt;&gt; OUR OBJECTIVE WAS SIMPLE, CAN

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:35.368
DOLPHINS ACQUIRE HUMAN LANGUAGE?
WHAT IF A DOLPHIN COULD SPEAK?

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:39.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; MAY 7th, 1965.
&gt;&gt; OUR SPECIMEN WAS A

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:43.143
15-YEAR-OLD MALE NAMED GERALD.
HE WAS VERY SMART, VERY STRONG

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:46.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
WILLED.
&gt;&gt; A.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:50.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
SEE MY MOUTH.
A.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:55.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
GERALD.
&gt;&gt; BUT AS GERALD REACHED

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
BREEDING AGE, HE BECAME LESS
FOCUSED.

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
AGITATED.
HIS NATURAL DRIVE WAS

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
DISTRACTING HIM FROM OUR WORK.
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, WHEN A DOLPHIN

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
REACHES SEXUAL MATURITY, THERE
IS NO STOPPING THEM.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:09.369
AND THEN ONE DAY I WAS IN THE
WATER WITH GERALD WHEN HE GOT

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:12.672
THAT GLASSY LOOK IN HIS EYE THAT
MEANT HE WAS HAVING AN URGE, SO

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:16.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
TO SPEAK.
AND SO I TURNED TO MARY AND I

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:20.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
SAID WHY DON'T I JUST YANK HIM
OFF REAL QUICK?

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
JUST LIKE THAT.
IT JUST CAME OUT.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:25.218
&gt;&gt; AT FIRST I WASN'T SURE IT WAS
ETHICAL BUT WE HAD TO, FOR THE

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:28.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
SCIENCE.
&gt;&gt; SO I DID IT.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:32.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
HEY.
RIGHT AWAY, YOU KNOW, HE WAS

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:37.130
CLEAR AS A BELL AND WE WERE ABLE
TO QUICKLY GET BACK TO OUR WORK.

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES.
AND SO IT BECAME PART OF OUR

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:40.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
ROUTINE.
WE WOULD WORK A WHILE, YANK A

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:45.905
WHILE, WORK A WHILE, YANK A
WHILE, THEN A TUG OR TWO AND

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:51.544
THEN TEACH A DOLPHIN TO SPEAK.
&gt;&gt; THEIR METHODS WERE UNORTHODOX

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.580
AND THEIR COLLEAGUES IN OTHER
PARTS OF THE LAB BEGAN TAKE

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
NOTICE.
&gt;&gt; I WAS ON THE ECHO LOCATION

00:01:56.382 --> 00:02:00.653
UNIT ACROSS THE HALL.
WE KNEW WHAT THEY WERE DOING IN

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:01.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
THERE.
I WROTE ABOUT IT IN MY FIELD

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:07.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
NOTES.
APRIL 21st, 1965.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:11.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
NO, NO, NO, THAT'S NASTY.
ALL OF YOU ARE NASTY.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:15.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
SICK PEOPLE, YANKING OFF THAT
FISH.

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.570
HELL NO.
&gt;&gt; FOR A WHILE THE PROGRESS WAS

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
ASTOUNDING.
HE LEARNED THE ALPHABET.

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:23.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; A.
&gt;&gt; A.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:26.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WE WERE ABLE TO TEACH HIM
SIGN LANGUAGE.

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:30.683
BUT SOON HE STARTED TO REGRESS.
REALLY ONLY DOING A FEW SIGNS.

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:40.160
THE SIGNS FOR HAND, AND NOW, AND
WHO GONNA J ME O, AND HURRY, AND

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:43.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; FISH, WATER.
&gt;&gt; I'M PRETTY SURE GERALD WAS

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:46.166
TALKING TO THE OTHER DOLPHINS
AND TELLING THEM, HEY, YOU DON'T

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:50.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
HAVE TO WORK FOR FISH.
THEY WILL DO OTHER THINGS.

00:02:50.703 --> 00:02:53.907
&gt;&gt; EVENTUALLY, THE HAND SESSIONS
TOOK UP MOST OF THE TIME.

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:56.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ALMOST SEVEN TO EIGHT HOURS
OF THE DAY.

00:02:56.376 --> 00:02:59.045
LATER I SUGGESTED A WAY OF
WORKING AS A TEAM, TO SORT OF

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:03.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
SPEED UP THE PROCESS.
WHEN SHE WAS THE HAND I WOULD

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:07.554
WOULD WAIT OUTSIDE THE DOOR, I
WOULD COUNT TO 20, I WOULD BUST

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:10.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
IN AND SAY WHO IS DOING NASTY
THINGS IN HERE?

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
BAD GERALD.
GERALD REALLY LIKED SHAME.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:17.463
AND THIS WAS GOOD, OF COURSE FOR
THE SCIENCE.

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:20.800
&gt;&gt; BUT AFTER TEN YEARS OF WORK
WITH GERALD HE WAS APPROVED FOR

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.070
A WELL DESERVED RETIREMENT FROM
THE RESEARCH LAB.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:27.674
&gt;&gt; IT WAS HARD TO SAY GOOD-BYE
TO GERALD, PHYSICALLY, BECAUSE

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:32.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
HE WAS FRANTICALLY TRYING TO
TURN IT INTO A SEX THING.

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:36.449 align:start size:94% position:6%
EVENTUALLY THEY CLEARED GERALD
FOR RELEASE INTO THE WILD.

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:44.891
BUT BOY, DO I STILL THINK OF HIM
FONDLY.

